Package: kitItemBank
Title: KIT Item Bank Query and Maintenance Tool
Version: 0.3.10
Date: 2026-11-03
Authors@R: person("Jie-Wen", "Tsai", email = "tsai.jiewen@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A 'shiny' app for the KIT item bank (Taiwan Early Childhood
    Development Survey Database): search items by keyword, wave and
    dimension, compare an item across waves and versions, browse dimensions
    with a network graph and dimension reports, list what each
    administration asked (codebook and SPSS label syntax), and edit
    dimension assignments. The item bank is stored in long format (one CSV
    per table). The app never writes files; edits are downloaded as a
    change package that maintainers apply with apply_patch().
